    {
      "id": "claim_c0bcd8cce715406dbf3f85c6604ddc7b",
      "statement": "Inside the iframe, console is monkey-patched to forward logs to the parent, uncaught errors and unhandled rejections are reported as console errors, Escape key presses are forwarded explicitly (the sandboxed iframe captures keydown), programmatic window.open is blocked while capture-phase handling adds noopener to target=_blank links, and the iframe element carries sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\".",
