    {
      "id": "claim_ff9d6ed03d4a46f38cc9441f36b97867",
      "statement": "The host-side gadget UI lifecycle guards against wedged loads: a 20s UI-bundle timeout offers a retry instead of an endless spinner, generation counters prevent superseded loads from writing state, the RPC session is disposed on unmount or reload, and a gadget change during the RPC handshake aborts the load.",
